# Hardware Configuration and Pinout

## Display Configuration (ST7701S)
The main display uses SPI for control and parallel RGB for data transfer:
- SPI Control Pins:
  - CLK: GPIO48
  - MOSI: GPIO47
  - CS: GPIO39
- Display Control:
  - DE: GPIO18
  - HSYNC: GPIO16
  - VSYNC: GPIO17
  - PCLK: GPIO21
- RGB Data Pins:
  - Red: GPIO11, GPIO12, GPIO13, GPIO14, GPIO0
  - Green: GPIO8, GPIO20, GPIO3, GPIO46, GPIO9, GPIO10
  - Blue: GPIO4, GPIO5, GPIO6, GPIO7, GPIO15

## Touchscreen Configuration (GT911)
I2C interface for touch control:
- SDA: GPIO19
- SCL: GPIO45

## Additional Hardware
- Backlight Control: GPIO38 (PWM via LEDC)

## Hardware Specifications
- Display Resolution: 480x480 pixels
- Display Color: RGB
- PCLK Frequency: 12MHz
- Touch Resolution: Matches display (480x480)

## Memory Configuration
- PSRAM: Octal mode @ 80MHz
- Flash Size: 16MB

## Notes
All pin configurations can be found in [dj-spl-meter.yaml](mdc:hardware/db-dj-display/dj-spl-meter.yaml)
